BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bruce Jacques Show at One Pelham East
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260525
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260526
DTSTAMP:20260824T110525Z
UID:1a094f507695de921be36457a8f9@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Bruce Jacques Show at One Pelham East When: Every Monday from 
 9:00 PM to 12:00 AM (May 25 - August 25\, 2026) Where: 1 Pelham East\, New
 port\, RI 02840 Bruce incorporates comedy spoofs of artists such as Queen
 \, Beyonce\, Guns and Roses\, Britney Spears\, Elvis\, and many more. His 
 repertoire is a mix of songs everyone knows by heart from the sixties to t
 oday’s top hits. He also involves the audience with a six foot L.E.D. li
 ght board that displays the words for sing-a-longs. Bruce's ability to con
 nect with audiences of all ages and in all types of settings is something 
 that comes only with years of experience. He also possesses the natural ab
 ility to make people feel comfortable - to make them laugh\, sing\, and da
 nce. Bruce's experience includes over three decades of private parties\, c
 orporate functions\, colleges\, nightclubs and resorts. Bruce has several 
 long-standing gigs including:\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/
 event/bruce-jacques-show-at-one-pelham-east/110092/
LOCATION:1 Pelham East\, 270 Thames Street\, Newport\, RI 02840
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/bruce-jacques-show-at-one-pelha
 m-east/110092/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Music at Sunset: Concert Series 2026
