 ure outdoor arts festival\, September 18-19\, 2026. This year’s festival
  returns to the beating heart of Downtown\, animating the streets of the C
 reative Capital with astonishing performances\, art installations\, parade
 s\, artisan markets\, and world-class cuisine. Discover a vibrant\, cultur
 al experience unlike anything else in the region. Attend\n\nSource: https:
 //www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/pvdfest-2026/104917/
